<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
  <style>
@@STYLE@@
    body { height: 620px; }
    .pane { position: relative; height: 250px; margin: 0 0 30px 0; }
    .caption { position: absolute; left: 40px; top: 0; width: 340px; }
    .caption h2 { margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700;
                  font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: .16em; }
    .caption p { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--dim); }
    .caption .bad { color: var(--warn); }
    .caption .ok  { color: var(--good); }
    .strip.crowded { grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .body-hint { position: absolute; left: 20%; right: 0; top: 55px; bottom: 0;
                 background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--hair);
                 display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
                 font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: .16em; color: rgba(153,170,187,.45); }
    .ruler { position: absolute; left: 20%; right: 0; top: 40px; height: 14px;
             border-left: 1px solid var(--hair); border-right: 1px solid var(--hair); }
    .ruler span { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 14px; transform: translateX(-50%);
                  font-size: 18px; color: var(--dim); background: var(--ground); padding: 0 8px; }
  </style>
</helmet>

<div style="position: relative; width: 1920px; height: 620px; padding-top: 30px;">

  <div class="pane">
    <div class="caption">
      <h2 class="bad">TODAY</h2>
      <p>Engineering in a dev build with lore registered: seven tabs plus the console
        back button, all eight slots spent. A ninth rolls into a <em>More (n)</em>
        dropdown. Order is .mast load order, reversed - it cannot be chosen.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="strip crowded" style="top: 0;">
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">debug</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">cargo</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">fabricate</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">upgrade</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">quest</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">library</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">help</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab back">engineering</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ruler"><span>8 of 8 slots - 192px each</span></div>
    <div class="body-hint" style="top: 90px;">CONSOLE BODY</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pane">
    <div class="caption">
      <h2 class="ok">ePADD</h2>
      <p>One button. Everything the strip carried moves inside it, grouped and named
        properly, scoped to the station that should see it. The console back button
        keeps its place and its color.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="strip" style="top: 0;">
      <div class="slot"></div>
      <div class="slot"></div>
      <div class="slot"></div>
      <div class="slot"></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab">ePADD</div></div>
      <div class="slot"><div class="tab back">engineering</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ruler"><span>2 of 6 slots - 256px each</span></div>
    <div class="body-hint" style="top: 90px;">CONSOLE BODY</div>
  </div>

</div>
</x-dc>

<script data-dc-script data-props='{"$preview": {"width": 1920, "height": 620}}'>
class Component extends DCLogic {}
</script>
</body>
</html>
